{"version":1,"content":"<p>梵蒂岡官方信仰通訊社日前報道，北京主教李山、新任江蘇海門主教丁祖耀、及香港教區主教周守仁本月5日將到羅馬出席研討會及發言，而出席同一場合及發言者還有梵蒂岡國務卿帕羅林。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:44.836129+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T16:04:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:44.898798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.768580+00:00","content_hash":"de9c9a640250e1f8284f4881374a0dd8cc8cdc436e8f7c9bf45bc11e2eff52b2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}